        "summary": {
          "en-US": "Read-only ROS 2 and DDS inspection on Android"
        },
        "description": {
          "en-US": "ROS Pocket is a read-only Android inspector using direct DDS and Cyclone DDS.\nInspect discovered topics, supported telemetry types and sensor views, monitor\nnumeric histories and export CSV, and manage portable local bench profiles.\n\nARM64 devices, Android 9 (API 28) or later. Network discovery depends on your\nROS domain, peers and network setup. RF/IP recovery is not qualified; a node\ntopology diagram is deferred to v2.\n\nThis is the independent upstream repository, not the official f-droid.org\ncatalogue. APKs keep the upstream production signature used by GitHub releases."
        },
